Article 21

Forms of services for victims provided by UPTD PPA include:

a. medical services;
b. medicolegal services (visum);
c. psychosocial services;
d. legal services;
e. economic independence services; and
f. spiritual services.

Article 4

Forms of violence against women and children include: a. physical violence;

b. psychological violence;

c. sexual violence;

d. neglect;

e. exploitation; and/or

f. other violence.

